===Format===
*'''Group Stages''' (Best-of-3)
**There will be two (or less) group stages (depending on the number of signups)
**A group comprises of 4 teams
**Groups are played in the [http://wiki.teamliquid.net/starcraft/Dual_tournament Dual Tournament Format] (only matches with stakes are played)
**The top 2 in each group will advance to the next stage
**From stage 1 to stage 2 the teams will advance in a way that won't repeat any match-ups
*'''Playoffs''' (Best-of-5 from Semis)
**[[QHLAN2017/Playoffs|8 players single-elimination bracket with bronze match]]
*'''Map picking'''
**Map pool: dm2, dm4, dm6, aerowalk, ztndm3. Dm6 may be switched with bravado, if both players agree beforehand
**Best-of-3: The higher seeded team decides if they want to pick first and toss last or vice versa (maps '''can''' be repeated)
**Best-of-5: The higher seeded team decides if they want to pick first or second (maps '''can't''' be repeated)
*'''Allowed clients'''
**ezQuake >= v2.1 (ruleset smackdown, qcon, thunderdome)
**FodQuake >= v0.2 (ruleset eql)
**FTEQW >= v1.0 (ruleset nqr)
*'''Game settings'''
**The default /2on2 settings on the QHLAN servers apply
